* Prompt currents leaving the full Al envelope; area divisor 1.
USRBDX            -1   NEUTRON       -24    ALCASE    VACREG         1PRNTOT
USRBDX          0.05     1E-14       6006.28318531         0         1 &
USRBDX            -1    PROTON       -24    ALCASE    VACREG         1PRPTOT
USRBDX          0.04     1E-08       6006.28318531         0         1 &
USRBDX            -1    PHOTON       -24    ALCASE    VACREG         1PRGTOT
USRBDX          0.03     1E-06       6006.28318531         0         1 &
* One-way proton currents; area divisor 1: integrated over each face.
* PIN: Ta -> target; POUT: target -> Cu (rear face only).
* PSIDE: target -> Al wall; PBACK: target -> Ta backscatter.
USRBDX             1    PROTON       -31     TAWIN       TGT         1PIN
USRBDX         $EMAX         0    $NEBIN6.28318531         0         1 &
USRBDX             1    PROTON       -31       TGT    CUBACK         1POUT
USRBDX         $EMAX         0    $NEBIN6.28318531         0         1 &
USRBDX             1    PROTON       -31       TGT    ALCASE         1PSIDE
USRBDX         $EMAX         0    $NEBIN6.28318531         0         1 &
USRBDX             1    PROTON       -31       TGT     TAWIN         1PBACK
USRBDX         $EMAX         0    $NEBIN6.28318531         0         1 &
* Delayed photons ALCASE -> VACREG: full external housing surface.
* L and B spectral grids overlap; never sum them.
USRBDX             1    PHOTON       -38    ALCASE    VACREG         1G001LTOT
